{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Shevet</b> (rod) — for striking, and reproof together with the rod gives wisdom to the simple." "<b>Meshulach</b> (sent out [to his own devices]) — left to go according to his desire, and his father does not discipline him — he brings shame upon his mother."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:23.009109253Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}